   "file": "TauCeti/Algebra/Algebra/Opposite.lean",
   "fix": "Add `@[simp] theorem toOppositeOfComm_apply (x : L) : f.toOppositeOfComm x = op (f x) := (rfl)` and make it a plain unexposed `def`.",
